@startuml
title Weather Station System State Diagram

[*] --> Idle

state "Idle" as Idle
state "Running" as Running
state "Configuration Mode" as ConfigurationMode
state "Shut Down" as ShutDown
state "Controlled Mode" as ControlledMode

Idle --> Running : [start]
Running --> ConfigurationMode : changes or power-saving settings required
ConfigurationMode --> Running : configuration completed
Running --> Running : clock trigger
Running --> ShutDown : shutdown command

Running --> ControlledMode : remote control
ControlledMode --> Running : activity completed

ShutDown --> [*]

@enduml
